# Local-only evaluation input and generated Tauri schemas.
#
# `test/` holds MIDI dropped in for local evaluation, whose licence and
# provenance are usually unknown, so it is ignored by default. Synthetic
# fixtures that are safe to commit live in `test/fixtures/`, which is
# deliberately exempt — see scripts/check-staged-files.mjs for the guard that
# keeps private audio out of a commit.
test/*
!test/fixtures/
test/private-midi/
src-tauri/gen/
playwright-report/
test-results/
blob-report/
